## Rules

- When run command, use *yarn run <command>* as command. DO NOT use *npm run <command>*.
- Always use *yarn* as package manager.
- Always use *vite* as build tool.
- Always use *react* as framework.
- Always use *typescript* as programming language.
- Always use *eslint* as linter.
- Always use *jest* as testing framework.
- Always use *react-testing-library* as testing library.
- Always use *react-dom* as testing library.
- Always use *react-router* as routing library.
- Always use *react-i18next* as internationalization library.